WEBVTT

00:00.834 --> 00:03.632
Chelsea and Ruri's Room
Stay out!

00:17.151 --> 00:20.052
We had finally made it
to the surface.

00:21.221 --> 00:23.917
And even though I had
stayed close by Ruri...

00:25.292 --> 00:27.522
...I still put her in
a dangerous situation.

00:40.841 --> 00:42.502
What're you thinking?

00:43.310 --> 00:44.004
Nothing.

00:45.379 --> 00:46.937
What am I supposed to do?

00:47.781 --> 00:49.874
I can't beat him with
what I've got.

00:51.185 --> 00:53.745
I know there's no way given
the limited skills I have now.

00:55.956 --> 00:59.790
How am I supposed to
fight against an enemy...

00:59.860 --> 01:01.760
...that I was barely able to
escape from?

01:02.896 --> 01:07.492
What am I supposed to do now?

01:10.637 --> 01:15.199
The abandoned subway line leads
into darkness.

01:15.642 --> 01:18.941
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

01:19.013 --> 01:23.347
...beneath Tokyo, this nation's capital...

01:23.417 --> 01:27.148
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

01:27.654 --> 01:31.454
The name of this world where
the sun does not shine is...

01:54.381 --> 01:58.078
yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

01:58.152 --> 02:01.610
kokoro umore naku nari sou

02:01.688 --> 02:05.249
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

02:05.325 --> 02:07.885
taisetsu na koto wa

02:07.961 --> 02:10.054
oshiete yo

02:10.130 --> 02:11.791
ne

02:12.032 --> 02:16.935
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

02:17.004 --> 02:21.634
Machigai dato omowa sete

02:22.443 --> 02:26.140
akireru hodoni aishiteta

02:26.213 --> 02:29.774
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

02:29.850 --> 02:33.342
osoreru koto nante nani

02:33.420 --> 02:37.015
hitotsu naito shinji teta

02:37.091 --> 02:40.549
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

02:40.627 --> 02:44.222
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

02:44.298 --> 02:47.631
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

02:47.701 --> 02:51.193
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

02:51.271 --> 02:57.107
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai

03:11.024 --> 03:14.161
Training and Resolve
Training and Resolve

03:14.161 --> 03:17.756
Training and Resolve

03:18.332 --> 03:20.197
We've got trouble!

03:22.002 --> 03:23.526
What's the matter, Ginnosuke?

03:25.172 --> 03:27.606
I was walking by
the station before, and...

03:27.674 --> 03:29.403
Walking by the station and...?

03:29.476 --> 03:30.875
There he was!

03:30.944 --> 03:32.002
Who?

03:32.312 --> 03:33.836
Your, you know...

03:39.219 --> 03:41.210
You pervert!

03:41.722 --> 03:44.020
No way! No ordinary man
could dodge that!

03:45.859 --> 03:49.488
That's not very polite,
trying to kick me like that.

03:51.965 --> 03:53.227
But...

03:53.300 --> 03:55.962
But you're the one that
grabbed my ass!

03:56.036 --> 03:57.697
Hey, Gramps!

03:57.771 --> 03:59.796
You've been gone for a month!

03:59.873 --> 04:02.671
You know how much trouble
I had to put up with?!

04:02.743 --> 04:03.300
What?

04:04.478 --> 04:07.936
Well, it looks like you've been
doing very well.

04:08.081 --> 04:09.810
Very good. Very good.

04:09.883 --> 04:11.578
Grandfather? Grandson?

04:11.652 --> 04:14.314
I see the family pervert resemblance.

04:19.560 --> 04:23.052
I've finally come home after
being away for a month.

04:23.130 --> 04:26.156
How sad that I get no word
of welcome from anyone.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.762
You just ran off to the hot springs.

04:30.771 --> 04:34.172
I guess I don't have
much time left...

04:35.108 --> 04:37.975
You sure like to play that
old man bit when it suits you!

04:38.045 --> 04:40.980
Anyway, that's enough
with the niceties.

04:41.048 --> 04:43.107
I want to hear about
what's going on.

04:43.183 --> 04:45.708
About that pretty girl
and the damaged house.

04:45.786 --> 04:49.847
And the big hole
in front of the temple hall.

04:50.390 --> 04:51.721
H-He's seen it all.

04:56.363 --> 04:59.958
Underground, special powers...

05:00.634 --> 05:02.067
Special powers, huh?

05:02.135 --> 05:03.500
That's right.

05:03.770 --> 05:05.795
Now you know, so just leave it.

05:05.872 --> 05:09.364
Not only did you get badly beaten...

05:09.443 --> 05:12.674
...but you lay helpless as your
girlfriend was taken away.

05:12.746 --> 05:16.546
What a shameful predicament.

05:17.084 --> 05:19.109
I didn't say that!

05:19.186 --> 05:21.416
But that's what happened, isn't it!

05:21.622 --> 05:24.216
And so, you want
to get stronger, right?

05:26.994 --> 05:28.256
Traditional style?

05:28.328 --> 05:29.090
That's right.

05:29.329 --> 05:31.058
Traditional Asagi Style.

05:31.465 --> 05:34.593
It's one of the traditional
sword fighting styles...

05:34.668 --> 05:38.160
...passed down through this
temple since the Edo days.

05:38.338 --> 05:40.568
Rumina's such a strong fighter...

05:40.641 --> 05:42.939
...because he's had
special training in it, right?

05:43.677 --> 05:45.804
Since I was little...

05:45.879 --> 05:49.610
...my sword training was
Gramps' idea of humiliating me.

05:50.150 --> 05:52.050
If you had been more serious...

05:52.119 --> 05:55.953
...perhaps you wouldn't have
failed that girl of yours.

05:56.023 --> 05:56.955
Shut up!

05:57.057 --> 05:58.615
You think I'm going to put up...

05:58.692 --> 05:59.488
Fine!

06:00.027 --> 06:01.016
Let's do it!

06:02.296 --> 06:06.164
I'm interested to know how good
those sword techniques are.

06:06.667 --> 06:07.656
And...

06:08.568 --> 06:11.401
I haven't thanked you for
what you did to me before!

06:13.407 --> 06:14.339
You sure?

06:14.541 --> 06:16.941
We're three against your one,
but we're not holding back!

06:17.477 --> 06:18.774
Why am I involved in this?

06:19.046 --> 06:20.411
Of course!

06:20.647 --> 06:22.877
I want to see your abilities!

06:22.949 --> 06:24.883
Don't you hold back!

06:25.085 --> 06:27.053
That's fine with me.

06:27.721 --> 06:28.983
You see...

06:31.258 --> 06:34.125
I never even considered
holding back!

06:36.563 --> 06:37.530
He dodged it!

06:40.367 --> 06:41.629
Well, this is quite astonishing.

06:41.702 --> 06:45.798
I never thought your special
power would be this strong.

06:49.209 --> 06:53.236
But there's no point in it if all
you're going to do is dig a hole.

06:54.281 --> 06:57.478
Hey! What're you two
just standing there for?!

06:58.018 --> 07:00.543
Chelsea's really getting into this.

07:00.787 --> 07:02.584
Yeah.
Seems like she's really pissed off.

07:02.789 --> 07:05.121
Come on, you two!

07:06.226 --> 07:08.091
You don't have to tell me twice!

07:08.695 --> 07:12.028
I don't need
any more of your training!

07:12.599 --> 07:14.191
I'll prove that to you!

07:19.272 --> 07:23.174
First it's the hole digging power,
and now you blow some dust.

07:23.243 --> 07:26.974
You fool! It's not just a power
you're dealing with!

07:28.281 --> 07:30.112
I can see right though you!

07:30.550 --> 07:31.414
Me, too.

07:36.556 --> 07:37.523
My, my...

07:37.624 --> 07:40.058
My grandson is
such an embarrassment.

07:51.872 --> 07:53.396
How shameful.

07:53.473 --> 07:57.273
The three of you can't muster the
strength to lay one finger on me.

07:58.311 --> 08:00.836
Is your grandfather
some kind of monster?!

08:01.348 --> 08:02.110
Maybe.

08:02.682 --> 08:06.345
Rumina, your approaches
are too direct.

08:06.486 --> 08:10.513
You're wasting the potential
of your special power.

08:10.590 --> 08:13.525
It seems like
you lack concentration.

08:13.727 --> 08:15.160
And you, pretty girl...

08:15.228 --> 08:18.561
You tend to rely on your power
too much.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.859
Um, what about me?

08:22.202 --> 08:23.169
You...

08:23.570 --> 08:24.935
You're not even an issue.

08:25.005 --> 08:26.131
Oh, come on...

08:31.478 --> 08:33.571
That's expected.

08:33.680 --> 08:37.309
You used more power
than you had to.

08:40.086 --> 08:41.246
Please!

08:42.055 --> 08:45.616
Please, I want you to train me...

08:45.692 --> 08:47.683
...in the Traditional Asagi Style!

08:48.295 --> 08:49.626
I want to...

08:49.696 --> 08:51.596
I want to save Ruri!

08:51.665 --> 08:54.793
I have to become much,
much stronger!

08:57.804 --> 09:00.671
He's made up his mind.
But what about you, pretty girl?

09:00.974 --> 09:01.463
Huh?

09:02.209 --> 09:07.272
Don't you think there's a problem
if you can't even lay a hand on me?

09:08.081 --> 09:10.015
I-I suppose...

09:10.083 --> 09:11.516
Then it's decided.

09:12.953 --> 09:13.749
Gramps...

09:14.354 --> 09:16.845
Training under me will be tough.

09:30.670 --> 09:32.069
Why am I a part of this?

09:58.131 --> 10:01.498
Get up! Practice isn't over yet!

10:01.801 --> 10:03.200
T-Time out!

10:04.070 --> 10:05.230
I-I'm going to be sick...

10:05.405 --> 10:07.771
If you think that's hard work...

10:07.841 --> 10:10.036
...there's no way you'll
be able to save that girl.

10:12.279 --> 10:14.611
Who said this is hard work?

10:15.015 --> 10:16.983
Th-This is nothing.

10:17.784 --> 10:21.311
Perhaps you have what it takes
after all.

10:22.889 --> 10:24.049
Gale Force Wind?

10:24.491 --> 10:25.219
That's right.

10:25.492 --> 10:29.758
The most secret of all the secrets
of the Traditional Asagi Style.

10:30.196 --> 10:31.629
Wh-What's that?

10:32.933 --> 10:34.491
I'll demonstrate.

10:34.568 --> 10:35.967
Now, watch carefully.

10:54.087 --> 10:55.782
He split that leaf in two!

10:55.855 --> 10:57.152
What?

10:57.223 --> 11:00.249
When you said a secret technique,
I was expecting something more.

11:00.327 --> 11:02.056
You just cut a leaf in half.

11:02.696 --> 11:05.096
I can do that easily myself.

11:05.465 --> 11:06.830
I wonder...

11:07.334 --> 11:07.857
Huh?

11:08.468 --> 11:09.594
Fine.

11:09.669 --> 11:11.193
Just try it.

11:14.574 --> 11:16.041
This is too easy.

11:27.754 --> 11:29.585
Hey! There's none falling off!

11:30.090 --> 11:32.615
You fool.
Patience is part of it.

11:32.759 --> 11:35.785
Or at least it should be,
but I'll help you out.

11:45.538 --> 11:46.835
Understand now?

11:46.906 --> 11:50.672
You can't cut a leaf simply by
striking powerful blows at it.

11:50.744 --> 11:52.609
Save some of the power...

11:52.679 --> 11:55.512
...and try to increase
the speed of the sword.

11:55.849 --> 11:58.875
Instead of striking a blow
as hard as you can...

11:58.952 --> 12:01.648
...you must see in your mind
the sword cutting through the leaf.

12:01.788 --> 12:03.085
Got that?

12:03.556 --> 12:04.284
Good.

12:04.357 --> 12:06.222
You're up next, pretty girl.

12:09.095 --> 12:10.426
I can't use my power?!

12:10.630 --> 12:11.324
That's right.

12:11.498 --> 12:15.730
You lose track of your surroundings
when you're using your power.

12:15.802 --> 12:19.568
I hope you're not planning
to pull anything funny.

12:20.040 --> 12:23.271
What are you suggesting?!
How rude!

12:26.880 --> 12:27.938
All right. Fine.

12:28.548 --> 12:31.346
Let's get started.

12:34.688 --> 12:35.552
Over here.

12:37.023 --> 12:38.285
Y-You!

12:38.591 --> 12:39.216
Again!

12:40.660 --> 12:43.857
Pretty girl, you may
have your power...

12:43.930 --> 12:46.626
...but you're not using it properly
in the form of an attack.

12:46.700 --> 12:48.861
Stop it, you creep!

12:51.304 --> 12:53.397
Whether it's with fists or feet...

12:53.473 --> 12:54.838
...it's all my own style.

12:55.108 --> 12:56.040
In other words...

12:56.109 --> 12:59.567
...use the flow of your body,
hold back on strength, and...

12:59.646 --> 13:01.204
...be aware of your technique.

13:01.281 --> 13:02.475
That way...

13:04.617 --> 13:08.075
...just maybe you'll be
able to touch me.

13:12.258 --> 13:14.783
Um, what about my training?

13:14.861 --> 13:17.056
You've got to build up
your strength.

13:17.130 --> 13:18.392
You should run.

13:18.565 --> 13:19.862
Oh no...

13:22.569 --> 13:25.003
Day One

13:26.206 --> 13:28.003
Day Two

13:29.042 --> 13:31.010
Day Three

13:32.078 --> 13:33.807
Day Four

13:34.514 --> 13:35.446
Day Five
That stings...

13:35.949 --> 13:36.881
Day Six

13:37.717 --> 13:39.344
Day Seven

13:41.721 --> 13:44.918
Day Eight

14:04.611 --> 14:05.805
I did it!

14:12.552 --> 14:14.019
I think you're ready.

14:14.454 --> 14:15.978
The final test?

14:16.422 --> 14:21.724
Deep in this cave is a treasure that
has long been kept at the temple.

14:21.795 --> 14:23.888
If you can retrieve that treasure...

14:23.963 --> 14:26.591
...you will have successfully
completed your training.

14:26.733 --> 14:27.563
Really?

14:27.634 --> 14:28.532
Wait a minute.

14:28.835 --> 14:31.497
What does that have to do
with our training?

14:32.172 --> 14:33.867
You'll know if you go.

14:37.310 --> 14:41.644
I guess Gramps is going to toy
with me 'til the very end.

14:42.015 --> 14:44.142
I don't know what this treasure is...

14:44.217 --> 14:46.014
...but we just have to go and get it,
right?

14:46.653 --> 14:47.915
That's a piece of cake.

14:48.488 --> 14:49.648
I hope so.

14:53.226 --> 14:53.920
What's this?

14:54.894 --> 14:56.623
It's started.

15:00.900 --> 15:01.867
What is that?

15:01.935 --> 15:04.267
Just the kind of trap Gramps
likes to set!

15:07.507 --> 15:10.943
When Ruri asked
to be taken to the school...

15:13.112 --> 15:17.048
I want to see a little more of this
world while I have the chance!

15:17.417 --> 15:21.513
I had a feeling she would be
taken back to the Underground.

15:21.888 --> 15:25.756
I knew how I felt and yet
was not able to protect her.

15:26.326 --> 15:28.191
Just running away is not enough!

15:28.328 --> 15:31.126
I'll make sure Ruri never has
to fear the Company again...

15:31.197 --> 15:34.428
...and is able to walk freely
on the surface world!

15:34.767 --> 15:37.736
I'll settle it with them
with my bare hands!

16:01.060 --> 16:02.152
That's...

16:02.595 --> 16:03.562
A sword?

16:04.898 --> 16:07.765
With all the traps set around here...

16:07.834 --> 16:10.701
...we can assume that
this one's a trap as well.

16:11.137 --> 16:12.729
This is incredible! Is it real?!

16:12.805 --> 16:14.932
Hey, didn't you hear me?!

16:15.074 --> 16:18.407
What're we going to do if it's
booby-trapped or something?

16:18.478 --> 16:21.709
Well, nothing happened.
So everything's fine.

16:24.417 --> 16:24.940
What?!

16:29.889 --> 16:32.824
See?! It's just as I said!

16:33.893 --> 16:35.155
What are we going to do?!

16:35.228 --> 16:36.718
Shut up!

16:36.796 --> 16:39.026
What's done is done!

16:45.138 --> 16:46.264
I'm gonna die!

16:46.606 --> 16:49.336
I can use my gravity power to...

16:52.912 --> 16:57.372
To think I'd have a chance to use
my ultimate technique so soon.

17:00.820 --> 17:01.752
This...

17:03.890 --> 17:05.016
This sword...

17:06.926 --> 17:07.654
The power!

17:09.295 --> 17:12.230
The Gale... no, that's not it.

17:18.805 --> 17:20.898
It's the Asagi Style...

17:20.974 --> 17:22.498
Gale Force Wind
Gale Force Wind!

17:28.281 --> 17:29.373
How's that?!

17:29.716 --> 17:32.082
You didn't have to butt in here.

17:32.151 --> 17:35.518
I could've taken care of that
little rock on my own.

17:35.588 --> 17:36.919
What was that, Blondie?!

17:36.990 --> 17:38.423
You heard me!

17:42.362 --> 17:44.990
I don't think this is the time
to be fighting.

17:45.064 --> 17:46.190
I agree.

17:46.466 --> 17:47.524
Run!

17:56.676 --> 17:58.735
Here. We got it for you.

18:00.079 --> 18:02.013
That is indeed the treasure.

18:02.081 --> 18:03.514
The Kogarasumaru.

18:03.850 --> 18:04.976
Kogarasumaru?

18:05.752 --> 18:06.582
That's right.

18:07.153 --> 18:09.815
A famous sword that has been
passed down...

18:09.956 --> 18:12.982
...the generations as the
guardian deity of the Asagi clan.

18:13.259 --> 18:16.353
There was a man called
Ittosai Asagi who lived...

18:16.429 --> 18:18.727
...during the Warring States Period.

18:19.032 --> 18:22.832
They say he struck down
a hundred men in a single charge.

18:23.903 --> 18:26.235
And he didn't use a sword.

18:26.339 --> 18:28.068
According to the ancient texts...

18:28.141 --> 18:32.373
...it is said that he struck down
those men by stirring up the wind.

18:36.182 --> 18:37.649
Don't tell me he had...

18:37.917 --> 18:40.078
I don't know if he had
a special power.

18:40.153 --> 18:45.250
But the sword carried by Ittosai
back then was the Kogarasumaru.

18:45.625 --> 18:46.717
Listen, Rumina.

18:46.793 --> 18:50.251
That sword is not for
cutting people down.

18:50.630 --> 18:52.222
Channel its energies.

18:52.298 --> 18:54.163
Sure thing. Thanks!

18:54.901 --> 18:57.802
Sorry, I don't have anything
for you.

18:57.870 --> 18:59.861
But don't feel too badly.

19:02.675 --> 19:05.337
Well, it looks like you've
benefited from the training.

19:14.921 --> 19:17.048
You sure don't have a care
in the world, do you?

19:19.225 --> 19:19.714
Hey.

19:28.167 --> 19:29.634
Are you sure about this?

19:29.702 --> 19:30.191
Huh?

19:30.703 --> 19:32.466
You are indeed strong.

19:33.172 --> 19:35.902
Certainly as a power user.

19:35.975 --> 19:39.240
And you're learning
incredibly fast.

19:40.980 --> 19:45.144
But unlike me,
you're a surface dweller.

19:45.985 --> 19:48.044
Once you enter the Underground...

19:48.121 --> 19:50.521
...there's no guarantee that
you'll ever be able to return.

19:50.590 --> 19:51.887
Do you still want to...

19:51.991 --> 19:53.253
Like I said...

19:56.362 --> 19:59.661
We've got to put
our strengths together!

19:59.799 --> 20:04.498
I've decided on my own terms
to go into the Underground.

20:04.704 --> 20:07.696
Even though I don't know
what this "Company" is.

20:07.773 --> 20:10.298
It's not like you to be so timid.

20:11.944 --> 20:14.640
I suppose if it's come to
you worrying about me...

20:14.714 --> 20:16.648
...that's the end for me.

20:17.083 --> 20:20.109
Gee.
You're such a hard case, Blondie.

20:20.520 --> 20:22.886
I wish you wouldn't call me that.

20:23.656 --> 20:27.319
You've never called me
by my name either.

20:28.461 --> 20:29.655
I suppose not.

20:34.300 --> 20:37.167
I'm coming, Ruri.

20:45.411 --> 20:50.246
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:50.316 --> 20:56.084
migakareru machi nami wo

20:56.155 --> 21:08.295
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:09.402 --> 21:20.245
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:20.313 --> 21:31.884
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:32.625 --> 21:41.499
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:41.567 --> 21:45.298
kikou to shita

21:45.371 --> 21:53.437
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:53.512 --> 22:01.749
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:11.364 --> 22:13.332
Preview

22:13.666 --> 22:16.829
I see myself returning
to my old world...

22:16.902 --> 22:19.336
...after having once escaped
with Ruri.

22:20.106 --> 22:24.042
Just because you're stronger now
it doesn't mean you can get cocky!

22:24.176 --> 22:26.576
You don't know the true power
of the Company!

22:26.979 --> 22:28.947
We're going to be doomed
at this rate...

22:29.015 --> 22:30.880
...let alone be able to rescue Ruri.

22:31.450 --> 22:33.509
No, I must rescue Ruri and
bring her back to the surface!

22:33.919 --> 22:36.387
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:36.455 --> 22:36.889
..."Charge into the Underground".

